    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d172">

                <pb facs="0383" n="125" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg125"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1561a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-27T14:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 27, 1915, 2 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>170. Press carries a despatch from Rome saying that Germany’s reply to Italy’s
                    memorandum regarding the war zone decree gives assurances that Germany will
                    respect the Italian flag. Please report if this is true.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
